  "body": "just debugged a server who left (in theory) and then nuked curbaf from its DB. however, matrix.org still sends it events from curbaf, resulting in it doing a massive explosion of federation traffic to try to fill in the missing events. surely if the room has been nuked or parted we should ignore spurious events like this.",
